    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasn't just some small mistake. it was huge. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who is fundamentally broken. like, no matter what a therapist says, you can't just \"process\" away being a bad person. some things are just permanent. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone who has to deal with me.",
